BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FIFA Bike Valet
DTSTART:20260718T163000Z
DTEND:20260719T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260717T073526Z
UID:954ce58a-a430-5bfc-956d-7915570d75aa
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that football fans can take advantage of FREE bik
 e parking with Cycle Toronto Bike Valet? Skip the traffic and bike with pe
 ace of mind!\n\nBike Valet opens one hour before and closes one hour after
  gates (subject to change).\n\nAll Fan Festival days (June 10 until July 1
 9):\n\n* Inukshuk (789 Lake Shore Blvd W\, Toronto)\n\nMatch days (June 12
 \, June 17\, June 20\, June 23\, June 26\, July 2):\n\n* Inukshuk (789 Lak
 e Shore Blvd W\, Toronto)\n* Hanna (15 Hanna Ave\, Toronto)\n* Ordnance (8
 01 Wellington St W\, Toronto)\n\nFind out more: (https://torontofwc26.ca/g
 etting-around) torontofwc26.ca/getting-around\n\nFAQ What does it cost?\n\
 nCycle Toronto Bike Valet is free! But if you appreciate the service\, con
 sider (https://www.cycleto.ca/join) becoming a member to support our work.
 \n\nCan I leave my helmet and bag?\n\nYes\, we can keep it all with your b
 ike.\n\nDo I need a lock?\n\nNo\, your bike is kept under the watchful eye
 s of our attendants in our secure perimeter.\n\nHow can I get Bike Valet f
 or my event?\n\nContact us: (https://www.cycleto.ca/bikevalet) cycleto.ca/
 bikevalet\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/fifa_bike_valet_20260718
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/fifa_bike_valet_20260718
END:VEVENT
